CC2 (X net0) capacitor c=1p
CC3 (net1 OUT_PM) capacitor c=1p
CC4 (OUT_PM net1) capacitor c=1p
MN1 (net0 net0 VSS VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
MN2 (OUT_PM net0 RF\- VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
