MP4 (OUT_NM OUT_PM DCout DCout) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
MP5 (X net1 RF\+ DCout) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
MP6 (net1 net1 DCout DCout) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
MP7 (X net1 RF\+ DCout) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
